Usage:
    habits list                          # list all habits
    habits summary                       # streak & completion stats
    habits entries [--days 7]            # recent entries
    habits check <habit> YES [--date D]  # check a habit
    habits check <habit> NO              # uncheck a habit
    habits coach <message> [--type T]    # send coaching message
"""

